LIFIED HER 2 CEP 17 ratio   REMOVED_DATE  EQUIVOCAL HER 2 CEP 17 ratio REMOVED_DATE to REMOVED_DATE  AMPLIFIED  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  CEP 17 ratio   REMOVED_DATE  NOTE  There is a notable difference in both the  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu protein overexpression  and FISH results between the core needle biopsy of the patient s mass  see   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the core needle biopsy of the lymph node metastasis  The  primary tumor shows 2  to 3  protein overexpression by immunohistochemistry   and is not amplified by FISH  ratio REMOVED_DATE 2   1 3   with no polysomy present   However the lymph node metastasis shows 3  overexpression by  immunohistochemistry and is equivocal for amplification by FISH  ratio 1 8   with an increased number of gene copies  5 6  and polysomy noted  This  difference between the primary core and metastasis core results suggests that  there is tumor heterogeneity for  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu overexpression in this case   Addendum  2 by Jane E  Brock M B   B S   Ph D   Electronically signed on  6 4  REMOVED_CASE_ID    report_end  , Positive.
